  "content": "<h3><em><strong><span style=\"color:#d4e132\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_e9f5aaa3-4ac4-4745-9703-57941a0253ad.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"826\" height=\"211\"> </span></strong></em></h3><h3><em><strong><span style=\"color:#d4e132\">&nbsp;这是一个以<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#db3535\">虚无世界3</span>为主题的整合包</span><span style=\"color:#d4e132\"><span style=\"color:#db3535\"> </span></span></strong></em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">(AoA3.7+),</span></strong><em><strong><span style=\"color:#d4e132\">玩家将体验一个<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">与众不同</span>的<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#db3554\">虚无世界3</span>。</span></strong></em></h3><h3><em><strong><span style=\"color:#396\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\">&nbsp; 它也是</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">一个</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">冒险与RPG</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#396\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\">但<span style=\"color:#e5cd39\">这个整合包一点也不难！</span></span></span></span></strong></em></h3><h3><em><strong><span style=\"color:#396\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\">&nbsp; 添加了许多<span style=\"color:#320ff2\">有趣的玩法</span>和<span style=\"color:#0e9d7b\">详细的任务书</span>，任务书会为玩家提供<span style=\"color:#db7235\">一些具体的游戏指南</span>，为游戏体验注入新鲜多样性。</span></span></strong></em></h3><h3><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\"><span style=\"color:#0fabf2\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></em><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\"><span style=\"color:#0fabf2\">精选模组精心打造，这个整合包将带给玩家</span></span><span style=\"color:#0fabf2\"><span style=\"color:#b67312\">与众不同的</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#0fabf2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#b67312\">Minecraft体验。</span></span></span></strong></em></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:16px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">&nbsp; 它旨在让玩家明白，虚无世界3不再像以前只是一个打怪模组，而是一个真正能带来乐趣的模组。</span></strong></em></span></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:16px\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">加入</span>官方Discord频道：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/h4jJymxJ8b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/h4jJymxJ8b</a></span>&nbsp;获取关于公共服务器和SoA3更新的更多信息。</span></strong></em></h3><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:16px\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_202a8c1b-d12f-4271-b238-a244f6b45cd0.jpg\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:16px\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_b95a2b24-25db-4fda-8ed5-11fa3b8e9adf.jpg\" alt=\"about\" width=\"396\" height=\"392\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_58aa4eae-cf9e-40c3-8bb2-338d4a8431be.jpg\" alt=\"quests\" width=\"399\" height=\"399\"></strong></em></span></p><h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_b52dc074-339e-48b5-b128-bd461727042e.jpg\" alt=\"Magnificent village\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#396\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#6f0ff2\">&nbsp; </span></strong></em></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_cdc143fd-cc62-451a-9c82-338a68161768.jpg\" alt=\"Beautiful Biomes\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_6166c444-5e42-456a-a56d-94075c669cf3.jpg\" alt=\"Dangerous dungeon\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081134/description_2f7d6733-9797-487a-ac7f-14ec36b86e00.jpg\" alt=\"Repurposed structures\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️大量<span style=\"color:#a4db35\">任务</span></strong></span></h3><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️众多维度<span style=\"color:#dadb35\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(虚无世界3,更深更暗)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️完全重做的世界生成<span style=\"color:#3d35db\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(超多生物群系)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️详细的任务系统&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#db3535\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(FTB任务,FTB小队)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#f75205\">数百个新的地牢和结构</span> </strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"color:#35db46\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(地牢崛起,重制结构)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️精美的装饰模组<span style=\"color:#db8d35\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(手工品,Macaw的桥梁,Macaw的栅栏和墙)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️辅助模组<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(动态光源,扩展存储,JEI, Jade,传送石碑</span> </em></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">)</span></em></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#db7235\"><em>Xaero的小地图</em></span><span style=\"color:#db7235\"><em>&nbsp;</em></span>指引方向</strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️农业和烹饪 <span style=\"color:#dbb935\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">(农夫乐事,末地乐事,万花筒烹饪)</span></em></span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️<em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">局域网世界即插即用</span>&nbsp;</em><span style=\"color:#db35ad\">与伙伴一起玩更佳</span></strong></span></h4><h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>✔️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">100+模组</span></strong></span></h4><h5>&nbsp;</h5>",
